# Extinguisher Battleship's trigger may target the Battleship itself (a noncreature permanent): it is destroyed, and the ability goes on
# to its second sentence all the same (CR 608.2c): the Battleship, gone, still deals 4 damage to each creature (its last known
# information, CR 608.2h), so Bot1's Ornithopter (0/2) and Bot2's Raging Goblin (1/1) die.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Extinguisher Battleship
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Raging Goblin
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
